The UI never polls: it subscribes to `OnChanged` in OnEnable, unsubscribes in OnDisable, and rebuilds the whole grid in that handler, which keeps the display exactly in sync with the data. Empty slots are drawn as dark tiles. Put both components on one object; I toggles the panel and G adds a random item to try it.

